\begin{document}

\section*{Structure Description}
Two order-statistic trees (balanced binary search trees with a size field at the nodes). One according to \(x\) and the other according to \(y\). A pointer to the \(n/4\) element in \(x\) and the \(3n/4\) element in \(y\).

\section*{Implementation of Insert Operation and Run Time Analysis}
Insert into both trees and perform select to update the pointers.

\section*{Implementation of Delete Operation and Run Time Analysis}
Delete from both trees and perform select to update the pointers.

\section*{Implementation of isCentric Operation and Run Time Analysis}
Check the ratio with respect to the \(x\) and \(y\) values of the pointers.

\end{document}
```

